# Map basemap tiles
#
# The map works with no key at all (Esri World Imagery / World Topo).
# Add ONE of these to enable a keyed provider. Restart `npm run dev` after editing.
#
# Provider priority: MapTiler > Mapbox > ArcGIS token > keyless Esri.

# MapTiler (free tier) — https://cloud.maptiler.com/account/keys/
# VITE_MAPTILER_KEY=your_maptiler_key

# Mapbox — https://account.mapbox.com/access-tokens/
# VITE_MAPBOX_TOKEN=pk.your_mapbox_token

# ArcGIS Online token, appended to the Esri tile URLs
# VITE_MAP_TILES_KEY=your_arcgis_token

# NASA FIRMS live fire detections (Live Fire Alerts page)
# https://firms.modaps.eosdis.nasa.gov/api/map_key/
#
# NO VITE_ prefix on purpose: the key is read server-side by vite.config.ts and
# proxied through /api/firms, so it never ships in the browser bundle.
# This is the recommended mode and works with `npm run dev` / `npm run preview`.
# On Vercel, add this as a project environment variable; the api/firms/*
# functions in this repo provide the same proxy in production.
FIRMS_MAP_KEY=your_32_char_firms_map_key

# Static-hosting fallback (GitHub Pages, S3, Figma Make publish, ...).
# Only needed when there is no Node server to run the /api/firms proxy.
# WARNING: VITE_ variables are embedded in the shipped JavaScript, so the key is
# public. Prefer a dedicated key that you can rotate, and keep it out of git.
# VITE_FIRMS_MAP_KEY=your_32_char_firms_map_key
